{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "69261545-1b51-46aa-90f6-ebe3bc10e64d",
    "name": "Authentication - OAuth V1",
    "description": "This Postman collection validates **OAuth V1 flows** for **Retail** and **Business** users using two grant types:\n\n- **Client Credentials** – Institution-level access for server-to-server communication\n    \n- **Password Grant** – User-level access via login credentials (Retail User only)\n    \n\n# Quick Links\n\n👤 Retail User\n\n- [Client Credential](https://extensibility-api.postman.co/workspace/68b02a61-3965-420f-b3b8-3bd911f20b6a/folder/8321995-30367a5c-d890-439e-b6b3-dcce23979b01?action=share&source=copy-link&creator=8321995)\n    \n- [Password](https://extensibility-api.postman.co/workspace/68b02a61-3965-420f-b3b8-3bd911f20b6a/folder/8321995-a0de25df-12fd-404b-b65a-365515543362?action=share&source=copy-link&creator=8321995)\n    \n\n🏢 Business User\n\n- [Client Credential](https://extensibility-api.postman.co/workspace/68b02a61-3965-420f-b3b8-3bd911f20b6a/folder/8321995-3ce75902-8e03-4828-bc35-15dcfafdf096?action=share&source=copy-link&creator=8321995)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "8321995",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/8321995-69261545-1b51-46aa-90f6-ebe3bc10e64d?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "👤 Retail User",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "🔗 Client Credential",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "1. Generate Access Token",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "const xml2js = require('xml2js');",
                      "",
                      "xml2js.parseString(pm.response.text(), function (error, jsonData) {",
                      "    if (error) {",
                      "        console.error(\"Error parsing XML:\", error);",
                      "        return;",
                      "    }",
                      "",
                      "    const accessToken = jsonData.token.access_token[0];",
                      "",
                      "    pm.environment.set(\"access_token\", accessToken);",
                      "});"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "packages": {},
                    "requests": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "basic": [
                    {
                      "key": "password",
                      "value": "{{client_secret}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "username",
                      "value": "{{client_id}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "di_tid",
                    "value": "{{$guid}}"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "di_fiid",
                    "value": "{{institution_id}}"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/xml"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "urlencoded",
                  "urlencoded": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "key": "grant_type",
                      "value": "client_credentials"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{apigee_base_url}}/v1/oauth/token",
                  "host": [
                    "{{apigee_base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "v1",
                    "oauth",
                    "token"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "2. Get Profile Information",
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "di_tid",
                    "value": "{{$guid}}",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/xml",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{apigee_base_url}}/bankingservices/v2/fis/{{institution_id}}/fiCustomers/{{retail_user_member_number}}?fiCustomerIdType=MEMNUMBER",
                  "host": [
                    "{{apigee_base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "bankingservices",
                    "v2",
                    "fis",
                    "{{institution_id}}",
                    "fiCustomers",
                    "{{retail_user_member_number}}"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "fiCustomerIdType",
                      "value": "MEMNUMBER"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Retrieve profile information to confirm the access token is valid.\n\n```\nGET /bankingservices/v2/fis/{{institution_id}}/fiCustomers/{{retail_user_member_number}}?fiCustomerIdType=MEMNUMBER\n```"
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ],
          "description": "## 🔄 Retail User – Client Credentials Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials. |\n| 2 | Get Profile Information | Access a protected resource using the access token. |"
        },
